@startuml
[*] --> Task Created : Create Task
Task Created --> Task Assigned : Assign Task
Task Assigned --> Task In Progress : Start Work
Task In Progress --> Task Completed : Complete Task
Task In Progress --> Task Waiting : Mark as Waiting
Task Waiting --> Task In Progress : Resume Task
Task Created --> Task Saved : Save Task
Task Assigned --> Task Saved : Save Task
Task In Progress --> Task Saved : Save Task
Task Waiting --> Task Saved : Save Task
Task Saved --> [*] : Restore Task
@enduml
